{"id":"9300003","name":"超級綠水靈","level":40,"desc":"等級：Lv.40 型態：精怪 原來是渺小且平凡的普通綠水靈，由於研究魔法的三姐妹而成為擁有巨大身軀的綠水靈。與其他綠水靈一樣，有著清澈的眼睛，和像果凍一樣圓滾的身體。但由於其巨大的身軀和重量，每跳出一小步也會使地面震動。現在三姐妹正在招募冒險家去阻止到處亂蹦的綠水靈。","stats":{"MADamage":165,"MDDamage":160,"PADamage":130,"PDDamage":160,"acc":140,"bodyAttack":1,"elemAttr":"I2F2L2H2","eva":10,"exp":800,"level":40,"maxHP":8000,"maxMP":100,"pushed":300,"rareItemDropLevel":2,"speed":-20,"undead":0},"boss":false,"elemental":{"summary":"火抗性、冰抗性、雷抗性、聖抗性","values":{"fire":"resist","ice":"resist","lightning":"resist","poison":"normal","holy":"resist"}},"meso":{"min":null,"max":null,"note":"","unverified":true},"maps":[{"id":103000804,"street":"維多利亞","name":"組隊訓練場<最後階段>","region":"維多利亞島","spawns":1,"link":true,"regionSource":"manual"},{"id":910340500,"street":"隱藏地圖","name":"第一次同行<最後的關隘>","region":"維多利亞島","spawns":1,"link":true,"regionSource":"manual"}],"drops":[{"id":4001008,"name":"通行證","cat":"其他","sub":"任務道具","link":true,"source":"monsterBook","questIds":[],"questNames":[],"dropConditions":[{"source":"tmsv113","sourceLabel":"TMS v113 端表","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/D363N6UY/MapleStory-v113-Server-Eimulator/blob/master/sql/tms.sql","rawMonsterId":9300003,"questId":0}],"sourceNote":""},{"id":2388001,"name":"超級綠水靈卡","cat":"消耗","sub":"怪物卡","link":true,"source":"monsterCard","sourceLabel":"怪物圖鑑卡","questIds":[],"questNames":[],"dropConditions":[{"source":"tmsv113","sourceLabel":"TMS v113 端表","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/D363N6UY/MapleStory-v113-Server-Eimulator/blob/master/sql/tms.sql","rawMonsterId":9300003,"questId":0}],"sourceNote":"怪物圖鑑卡"},{"id":1072369,"name":"黏稠稠鞋子","cat":"裝備","sub":"鞋子","link":true,"source":"supplemental","sourceLabel":"補充掉落","questIds":[],"questNames":[],"dropConditions":[{"source":"tmsv113","sourceLabel":"TMS v113 端表","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/D363N6UY/MapleStory-v113-Server-Eimulator/blob/master/sql/tms.sql","rawMonsterId":9300003,"questId":0}],"sourceNote":"補充掉落","equip":{"incDEX":1,"incINT":1,"incLUK":1,"incMDD":5,"incPD